  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>A very generous donor has offered to match all donations up to $10,000. Donations can be made through <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=47&amp;&amp;test=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=47&amp;&amp;test=true\">this form</a>. We realize these are unsettling and uncertain times for many, so we are keeping our upcoming webinar completely free (see below). If you are able to and would like to support our work, now is a great time to do so, thanks to this wonderful donor. </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">COVID-19 Info Page and Another Webinar</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63401 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1.png\" alt=\"Coronavirus image\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1.png 1080w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/Coronavirus-Square-1-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>With my <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How Not to Diet</a></em> book tour suspended, the COVID-19 crisis allowed me an opportunity to draw on my past expertise on emerging infectious disease to fast-track a new book on pandemic survival and prevention that will be out next month(!). <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>How to Survive a Pandemic</em></a> is now available for preorder as an e-book and audiobook (Amazon preorders are now live!) Physical copies will be out this fall.<p></p>\n<p>But you don’t have to wait for the book to learn more about how we got into this situation and what we can do now. Check out these resources all about COVID-19 and pandemics: </p></div>\n<ul>\n<li>COVID-19 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Info Page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/blog/takeaways-from-my-webinar-on-covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blog post</a> based on my last webinar</li>\n<li>Replays of special live Q&amp;As on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/videos/651039495460826/?__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARAkT5eVLU9fFyR3SBMnU0JebkSZd0wtpvwEg0KZOlT42EjlgrqjpEGQDNqUDmaA_OaUwd68RLRfFp9hHmS6HviOOP_UuhrS8IvEasWNLU9d3boo8M_4ur9ZTyIBhFdX3vYlki3nMKmNG280z0zuMPHomGSH78RwEiRNreO0g1rPwsBcJicTKHtuLN2AMacUZqdd8Y49TU0iEufKYxYLEnd7a8Jttk7kp_9lzjdqHeBYtVOdXhoEDxtx7ioquCG_mkSRNkxhpa7a3tK7RFudTNfkk_bli-N5hBY7VrUzrhXKoT6znoh8_s2KxGy4_46jf2IimeGJNQMbp_L5ixuRSscPjB1aezeC&amp;__tn__=-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/videos/651039495460826/?__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARAkT5eVLU9fFyR3SBMnU0JebkSZd0wtpvwEg0KZOlT42EjlgrqjpEGQDNqUDmaA_OaUwd68RLRfFp9hHmS6HviOOP_UuhrS8IvEasWNLU9d3boo8M_4ur9ZTyIBhFdX3vYlki3nMKmNG280z0zuMPHomGSH78RwEiRNreO0g1rPwsBcJicTKHtuLN2AMacUZqdd8Y49TU0iEufKYxYLEnd7a8Jttk7kp_9lzjdqHeBYtVOdXhoEDxtx7ioquCG_mkSRNkxhpa7a3tK7RFudTNfkk_bli-N5hBY7VrUzrhXKoT6znoh8_s2KxGy4_46jf2IimeGJNQMbp_L5ixuRSscPjB1aezeC&amp;__tn__=-R\">Facebook</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kMsHN2BdOzs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kMsHN2BdOzs\">YouTube</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/pandemics-history-prevention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pandemics: History &amp; Prevention</a> video</li>\n<li>I’ve also been doing several interviews about this issue, including one with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N0pvR92XT30&amp;mc_cid=af306f6729&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DN0pvR92XT30%26mc_cid%3Daf306f6729%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1587237012553000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEK7wr58rjxJZFTnLmc3x730FWNlg\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N0pvR92XT30&amp;mc_cid=af306f6729&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\">Earthling Ed</a><span style=\"color: #292b2c;\"> and another with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6f6KTkZSU64&amp;t=603s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3D6f6KTkZSU64%26t%3D603s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1587237012553000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEXQm3j5kW3c28seo-Ot9ZRkWYPLA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6f6KTkZSU64&amp;t=603s\">Plant Based News</a>.</span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>The digital download of videos from my 2nd pandemic webinar can be found <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/how-to-survive-a-pandemic-digital\">here</a> (free for a limited time). To be the first to see announcements of future webinars, be sure you <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\">subscribe</a> to our newsletter.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-60211 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"501\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 501px) 100vw, 501px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"null\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63045 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1.png\" alt=\"Pandemic-Thumbnail (1)\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1.png 1920w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/Pandemic-Thumbnail-1-540x304.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a><a style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/pandemics-history-prevention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pandemics: History &amp; Prevention</a></p>\n<p>How to treat the cause by preventing the emergence of pandemic viruses in the first place (a video I recorded more than a decade ago when I was Public Health Director at the HSUS in Washington DC).</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"null\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63089 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"What Are the Best Foods\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-26.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-are-the-best-foods/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">What Are the Best Foods?</a></p>\n<p>A review of reviews on the health effects of animal foods versus plant foods.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"null\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-62787 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Cut the Calorie-Rich-and-Processed Foods\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/04/50-4.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/cut-the-calorie-rich-and-processed-foods/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cut the Calorie-Rich-And-Processed Foods</a></p>\n<p>We have an uncanny ability to pick out the subtle distinctions in calorie density of foods, but only within the natural range.</p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;As TODAY, April 23</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"201\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>today, April 23</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET TODAY go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET TODAY go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>"
